📘 TOPIC SHEET 4: Views (Public vs Personal vs System)
(~12 questions — appears more than ANY other topic!)
________________________________________
📖 Concept
View Type	Created By	Visible To	Editable By	Where Created
Public View	Maker/Customizer	All users with table access	Maker/Customizer	Solution → Tables → Views (Maker Portal)
Personal View	Individual user	Only that user (unless shared)	That user	Advanced Find → Save As
System View	System (OOB)	All users	Maker/Customizer can modify	Pre-built (e.g., "Active Accounts")
Quick Find View	Maker/Customizer	All users (search results)	Maker/Customizer	Solution → Tables → Views
Lookup View	Maker/Customizer	All users (lookup dropdowns)	Maker/Customizer	Solution → Tables → Views
Associated View	System	All users (subgrids)	Maker/Customizer	Solution → Tables → Views
🧠 The Exam's Favorite Question
"You need to create a view visible to ALL users. No custom code. Where do you create it?"
Answer: Maker Portal (make.powerapps.com → Tables → Views) or Entities/Tables component of a solution
NOT:
•	❌ Advanced Find (= personal views)
•	❌ Visual Studio (= custom code)
•	❌ Excel template (= export, not a view)
•	❌ System Settings (= admin settings, not views)
•	❌ Templates area (= document templates)
________________________________________
🔑 Rules to Memorize
Rule	Remember
1	Public view for all users = create in Maker Portal / Solution
2	Advanced Find = creates Personal views (only visible to creator)
3	No custom code + view for all users = Maker Portal (always)
4	Quick Find View = controls which columns are searched in Quick Find
5	Lookup View = controls what users see in lookup field dropdowns
6	You can share a personal view, but it's still personal
________________________________________
📝 All Related Questions + Answers
Q4, Q42, Q54, Q56-57, Q66-67, Q103, Q179-180: "Create view for all users, no custom code"
This SAME question appears 8+ times with slightly different wrong answers:
Answer: ✅ Entities/Tables component of a solution OR Maker Portal
❌ Advanced Find = personal view
❌ Visual Studio = custom code
❌ Excel template = not a view
❌ Templates area = not a view
❌ System Settings = not views
❌ List view of entity = this refers to Portal Lists (Power Pages), not model-driven views
________________________________________
Q76: Column vs View
•	Add alternate phone number → Column (add column to table)
•	List customers without phone number → View (create filtered public view)
________________________________________
Q96: Prevent filtering on custom field
Answer: Set Searchable = No on Field Properties
This removes the field from Advanced Find filter options
________________________________________
Q108: Display events by venue in calendar
Answer: Add a control to a View (calendar control on a view)
Not form, not chart, not subgrid
________________________________________
Q228: Underage Prospects view filter
Filter: Current Age is less than 18
Why Current Age and not Birthdate? Because Current Age is a calculated field that auto-updates — the view stays correct without modifications
Why not "Age at Registration"? That's fixed at registration time, not current
________________________________________
